    txna ApplicationArgs 1; btoi 
    txna ApplicationArgs 2; btoi 
    txna ApplicationArgs 3; btoi 
    txna ApplicationArgs 4; btoi 
    txna ApplicationArgs 5; btoi 
    txna ApplicationArgs 6; btoi 
